# The distribution is a binary payload. A line-ending translation on checkout
# would rewrite bytes inside a DLL, and the file would still look plausible --
# it would simply fail to load, on the users' machines rather than here.
*.dll binary
# tools/gle32.zip, the archive three of the shipped GLE files came out of.
*.zip binary

# The upstream licence and readme files ship verbatim, so they are not ours to
# re-line-end either: a redistributed licence should be byte-for-byte what was
# given to us.
src/pyopengl_glut_binaries/DLLS/*.txt -text
src/pyopengl_glut_binaries/DLLS/gle_AUTHORS -text
src/pyopengl_glut_binaries/DLLS/gle_COPYING -text
src/pyopengl_glut_binaries/DLLS/gle_COPYING.src -text
